{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）早上10時10分，警方接報指，葵涌興寧路12號近新都會廣場對開，有一輛垃圾車撞倒一名女途人，事主陷入昏迷，救援人員趕抵救援，經檢驗後於現場證實不治。意外原因仍有待調查。據知，事主年約80多歲。</p><p>現場位於新都會廣場對開，路中遺下一隻相信是屬於事主的鞋；現場可見，垃圾車車底捲入一部裝有紙皮的手推車。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一隻相信是屬於事主的鞋。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169963198615392256592307.jpeg/4XteD2krJUYThKa4hQJ7wTK5ze9fgnZYilGMqKBRjKg\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一隻相信是屬於事主的鞋。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員以白布遮蓋遺體。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169960120579264512415823.jpeg/S9mVxu4vty2YhOJh4JF-Esrs19rJlS7NmzHak74x2pM\"/><figcaption>人員以白布遮蓋遺體。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"垃圾車車底捲入一部裝有紙皮的手推車。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169962064748351488459821.jpeg/yP1cxcScqpuZd0DDdQ7SzatZyx2c1BDH14inhv2Ip4Y\"/><figcaption>垃圾車車底捲入一部裝有紙皮的手推車。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"垃圾車車底有一部裝有紙皮的手推車。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169962061623463936625718.jpeg/vHwxXriYCNXk0bJpZSNGWIktqE6GxAIEEjBJ1DgwSdQ\"/><figcaption>垃圾車車底有一部裝有紙皮的手推車。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方檢走一個環保袋，相信屬於死者。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169963475095654400086397.jpeg/uDMChtA1aD3QpGv40M3GMNajzEhgbLrWpHRIWY50SFk\"/><figcaption>警方檢走一個環保袋，相信屬於死者。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169963471962378240780631.jpeg/PRrofyGP663QgcJjxJ6XreTIQtQ1Df_FfPmbOlb5mzo\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"地面遺下一隻鞋，相信屬於事主。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169964962693517312850431.jpeg/-fsQUpadmjAiUeb8drdFrdLoZHFRH2SfXJ5fU3aeX1M\"/><figcaption>地面遺下一隻鞋，相信屬於事主。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方正在場調查涉事垃圾車。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169960124987609088302849.jpeg/mGQtSpL8xP04LcevPnnQJBc0r2WLv3qRy8mMGO7JjBg\"/><figcaption>警方正在場調查涉事垃圾車。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T03:20:41.805105+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}